<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>八股 on Ruoke Zhang</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/tags/%E5%85%AB%E8%82%A1/</link><description>Recent content in 八股 on Ruoke Zhang</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 17 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ruokezhang.github.io/tags/%E5%85%AB%E8%82%A1/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MySQL锁</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/mysql/lock/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/mysql/lock/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="全局锁">全局锁
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%85%a8%e5%b1%80%e9%94%81">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>一般在做&lt;strong>全库备份&lt;/strong>的时候用到。会阻塞写操作，只允许读请求。因此一般选在业务低峰期去做全库备份。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>flush tables &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">with&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">read&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">lock&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="表级锁">表级锁
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%a1%a8%e7%ba%a7%e9%94%81">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="表锁">表锁
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%a1%a8%e9%94%81">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>表共享读锁。多个线程能同时获取这个锁，获取锁的线程可以读这个表，但不能写这个表。MyISAM 处理读请求时，会获取该表的表共享读锁。而 InnoDB 默认是&lt;strong>行锁&lt;/strong>，通过 MVCC 来处理读请求。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>表独占写锁。只有一个线程能获取这个锁，它可以对表进行写操作。其它任何线程都不可以读这张表。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8839ef">lock&lt;/span> tables t_student &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">read&lt;/span>;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>触发表锁：ALTER/DROP/TRUNCATE TABLE&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Transaction</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/mysql/transactionmysql/</link><pubDate>Sun, 02 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/mysql/transactionmysql/</guid><description>&lt;p>参考：小林 coding&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="事务的特性">事务的特性
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%8b%e5%8a%a1%e7%9a%84%e7%89%b9%e6%80%a7">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>atomicity: undo log&lt;/p>
&lt;p>consistency: 由其他三个特性实现.事务在执行前后，数据库从一个一致性状态转变到另一个一致性状态。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>isolation: MVCC/lock.一个事物的执行不影响其它事务的执行&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>索引</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/mysql/sqlindex/</link><pubDate>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/mysql/sqlindex/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="聚簇索引二级索引">聚簇索引、二级索引
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%81%9a%e7%b0%87%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e4%ba%8c%e7%ba%a7%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="聚簇索引">聚簇索引
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%81%9a%e7%b0%87%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>InnoDB中，每个表都有一个聚簇索引，它决定着数据在磁盘上存储的物理顺序。&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>如果有 primary key, 即为聚簇索引&lt;/li>
&lt;li>如果没有 primary key, 选择一个唯一的非空索引作为聚簇索引&lt;/li>
&lt;li>如果还是没有，InnoDB隐式地创建一个自增列作为聚簇索引&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;h3 id="b-tree">B+ Tree
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#b-tree">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>InnoDB在默认情况下，聚簇索引和二级索引都使用 B+ Tree存储。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>ThreadLocal&amp;线程池</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/juc/threadlocal/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/juc/threadlocal/</guid><description>&lt;p>参考：JavaGuide&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="threadlocal">ThreadLocal
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#threadlocal">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Thread类里面有一个变量threadLocals，可以视为一个 HashMap，用来存放线程私有的内容。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#9ca0b0;font-style:italic">/* ThreadLocal values pertaining to this thread. This map is maintained
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#9ca0b0;font-style:italic"> * by the ThreadLocal class. */&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>ThreadLocal.&lt;span style="color:#1e66f5">ThreadLocalMap&lt;/span> threadLocals &lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#fe640b">null&lt;/span>;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>ThreadLocal类里面有一个instance 方法 set,实际上是把内容存在threadLocals里面。key是该ThreadLocal对象自己。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>JMM</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/juc/jmm/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/juc/jmm/</guid><description>&lt;p>参考：JavaGuide&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="并发问题">并发问题
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%b9%b6%e5%8f%91%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="cpu-cache">CPU Cache
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#cpu-cache">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://ruokezhang.github.io/imgs/img-lazy-loading.gif" data-src="https://ruokezhang.github.io/CPUCache.png" alt="Alt text" />
Cahce中某个变量的值可能与 Main memory中的值不一致，导致计算出错。&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="指令级重排">指令级重排
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%8c%87%e4%bb%a4%e7%ba%a7%e9%87%8d%e6%8e%92">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;h3 id="编译器优化重排">编译器优化重排
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%bc%96%e8%af%91%e5%99%a8%e4%bc%98%e5%8c%96%e9%87%8d%e6%8e%92">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>JVM, JIT做这件事。对于Java程序，在不改变它的语义的情况下，编译时进行指令重排序，类似g1, g2 optimization的重排。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Java线程</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/juc/thread/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/juc/thread/</guid><description>&lt;p>参考：JavaGuide&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="线程">线程
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%ba%bf%e7%a8%8b">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="线程的实现">线程的实现
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%ba%bf%e7%a8%8b%e7%9a%84%e5%ae%9e%e7%8e%b0">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>一个Java程序作为一个进程，运行时实际上是多线程并发的, main函数就是主线程。每个调用过start()方法，并且还未结束的java.lang.Thread类的实例就是一个线程。Java线程是Java程序的并发执行单位。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>try-catch-finally</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/trycatchfinally/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/java/trycatchfinally/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>